	(text "J2：背面焊盘，间距1.27mm；1=3V3，2=GND，3=SWDIO，4=SWCLK。\n3V3 作 VTref；外部供电时不并接下载器电源。\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 76.2 177.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Microsoft YaHei")
				(size 1 1)
				(bold yes)
				(color 52 58 64 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "416b9072-1d17-44df-b394-29c02a0c45fc")
	)
	(text "C2/C3：各 VDD 去耦；C4/C5：VDDA 去耦。\nEPAD 33 必须焊接；BOOT0 使用 2.2k 下拉。"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 81.28 156.21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Microsoft YaHei")
				(size 1.05 1.05)
				(bold yes)
				(color 52 58 64 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "41e6c83b-cc64-503b-8ea4-5d86741c2be9")
	)
	(text "目标 55°C 须校准；65°C 软件关断，无独立硬件过温保护。\n内温 SPI 0x20/21：25 + raw/256；偏移可达 ±15°C（DS13510 Rev2 p15）。PWM 20kHz / PI 10Hz 起调。\n建议整板预留 250mA；最高自然温度宜 ≤45–50°C，低温加热能力须实测。超时关断，启用看门狗。"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 187.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Microsoft YaHei")
				(size 0.98 0.98)
				(bold yes)
				(color 52 58 64 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "424f20b1-5f32-4c60-a102-66fa93733c41")
	)
